11. Willing and able to comply with research protocols and visit plans.

Exclusion Criteria:

1. Prior to enrollment, ctDNA testing shows known KRAS mutation, NRAS mutation, or ERBB2 gene amplification; tumor tissue testing shows mismatch repair gene deficiency or high microsatellite instability, KRAS mutation, NRAS mutation, or ERBB2 gene amplification;
