4. Active coronary artery disease, severe/unstable angina, or newly diagnosed angina or myocardial infarction within 12 months prior to study participation;
5. Occurrence of thrombotic or embolic events within the past 6 months;
6. New York Heart Association (NYHA) class II or higher congestive heart failure;
