6. Use of CYP3A4, CYP2C8 and UGT1A1 strong inhibitors/strong inducers within 14 days before starting the study. 7. Participated in other drug clinical trials within 4 weeks before the first dose;
7. Participated in clinical trials of other drugs within 4 weeks before the first medication;
8. Clinical records showed severe gastrointestinal dysfunction (including bleeding and obstruction; NCI-CTCAE v5.0 \> Grade 2 inflammation; NCI-CTCAE v5.0 \> Grade 1 diarrhea)
